%% Classic reduce test - INVALID (coverage failure)
%% Per spec v0.6: _? accepts consumed terms, but coverage requires
%% clauses to accept ALL input paths. and(...) and or(...) alone don't cover _?.
%% Also: Result? in original at output position needs moded head flip to Result.
procedure reduce(_?, _).
reduce(and(A, B), Result?).
reduce(or(A, B), Result?).
